<title>USA: TALKING POINT- Boston Beer, microbeers tank.</title>
<headline>TALKING POINT- Boston Beer, microbeers tank.</headline>
<byline>Jennifer Westhoven</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microbrewery stocks took a nosedive on Wednesday after industry leader Boston Beer Co Inc said its orders were lower than expected.</p>
<p>A selling wave sheared 20 percent off Boston Beer, maker of Samuel Adams beers, after it said October/November 1996 orders grew only 5.5 percent over shipments for the same period last year.</p>
<p>The stock lost 3-1/4 to 12-3/4, a new all-time low.</p>
</text>
